Conceptually the structure should become:

Human Quick Battle fighter → PlayerController

Quick Battle CPU fighter → CombatAIController

Practice CPU → TrainingAIController

The new combat AI must be data-driven enough to work with future fighters instead of hard-coding #0001 throughout the controller.

